# Route: guide 42 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to
# 60, 39 quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Western Plaguelands, Swamp of Sorrows, Blasted Lands, Thousand
# Needles, Winterspring): Felstone Field -> The Writhing Haunt -> Dalson's
# Tears -> Gahrron's Withering -> Thondroril River -> Ruins of Andorhal ->
# Darrowmere Lake -> Stagalbog -> Misty Reed Strand -> Stonard -> Misty Reed
# Strand -> Splinterspear Junction -> Serpent's Coil -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Nothing But The Truth (1383;
# Deepstrider Giant 38-39, Deepstrider Searcher 39-40); Arikara (5088; Arikara
# 28); High Chief Winterfall (5121; High Chief Winterfall 59); The Final Piece
# (5123; High Chief Winterfall 59).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the
# Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors
# (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Oculus Illusions (6569), Gahz'rilla
# (2770).

